    "return.achievement_village_return_event_2b.name": "Found: the neighbour's map",
    "return.campaign.description": "A homecoming in three acts: arrival, reality, and the difficult art of settling.",
    "return.campaign.title": "Return",
    "return.city_return_1.listen": "Answer every question without performing expatriate expertise",
    "return.city_return_1.push": "Explain how customs works elsewhere",
    "return.city_return_1.text": "The customs officer studies the espresso machine in your luggage as if it has requested citizenship.",
    "return.city_return_2.improvise": "Trust the photographs",
    "return.city_return_2.prepare": "Call the landlord before viewing",
    "return.city_return_2.text": "Your first landlord quotes rent in euros and nostalgia in leva. The apartment has a view of three parking disputes.",
    "return.city_return_3.favour": "Call in the favour you earned",
    "return.city_return_3.favour_fail": "No one owes you that favour yet.",
    "return.city_return_3.steady": "Use what you prepared",
    "return.city_return_3.text": "An old colleague offers introductions, warnings, and a desk that becomes available whenever its owner moves the printer.",
    "return.city_return_4.ending_city_with_open_eyes": "The Sceptical Returner",
    "return.city_return_4.ending_optimistic_return": "The Returner",
    "return.city_return_4.text": "A month later the city no longer feels foreign, which is not the same thing as feeling easy. You decide what returning will mean.",
    "return.city_return_event_1.text": "The day contributes its own amendment.",
    "return.city_return_event_1a.proceed": "Keep the stamped luggage slip",
    "return.city_return_event_1a.text": "The luggage slip gets you through a second inspection in twelve seconds.",
    "return.city_return_event_1b.proceed": "Accept the officer's improvised declaration",
    "return.city_return_event_1b.text": "A shift change starts the entire conversation again, now with chairs.",
    "return.city_return_event_2.text": "A seeded interruption arrives on schedule.",
    "return.city_return_event_2a.proceed": "Meet the old colleague for coffee",
    "return.city_return_event_2a.text": "Your colleague remembers the one clerk who still answers email.",
    "return.city_return_event_2b.proceed": "Follow a cheaper-flat lead",
    "return.city_return_event_2b.text": "The cheaper flat is real; the bathroom is an interpretive proposal.",
    "return.ending_city_with_open_eyes.text": "The Sceptical Returner\n\nYou stay without pretending the city is perfect or that abroad ever was.",
    "return.ending_exhausted_departure.text": "The Open Return Ticket\n\nYou leave exhausted, keeping the key. Some decisions need distance before they become answers.",
    "return.ending_home_again.text": "Home Again\n\nThe questions become routine, the advice ambient, and the mechanic recommendation useful. You stay.",
    "return.ending_optimistic_return.text": "The Returner\n\nYou build a life from old streets and new boundaries. Home becomes a verb again.",
    "return.ending_settled_in_the_village.text": "A Light in the Village\n\nYou stay. The roof holds, the neighbours knock, and the silence finally includes you.",
    "return.expat_returns.choice_accept_destiny": "Accept your destiny and stay in the city",
    "return.expat_returns.choice_explain": "Explain nothing; take the village road",
    "return.expat_returns.choice_laugh": "Laugh and book a room for one more week",
    "return.expat_returns.choice_smile": "Smile and try the city again",
    "return.expat_returns.text": "After years abroad, you land in Sofia with two suitcases and a theory that coming home will be simpler than leaving. Customs, family, and the airport taxi rank have prepared counterarguments.",
    "return.temporary_return_1.listen": "Ask the receptionist what changed",
    "return.temporary_return_1.push": "Keep the booking strictly temporary",
    "return.temporary_return_1.text": "The hotel receptionist recognizes your accent, upgrades your opinion, and asks when you are leaving again.",
    "return.temporary_return_2.improvise": "Open the airline app instead",
    "return.temporary_return_2.prepare": "Inspect the apartment key",
    "return.temporary_return_2.text": "Family lunches expand to occupy every decision you postponed while abroad.",
    "return.temporary_return_3.favour": "Call in the favour you earned",
    "return.temporary_return_3.favour_fail": "No one owes you that favour yet.",
    "return.temporary_return_3.steady": "Use what you prepared",
    "return.temporary_return_3.text": "A return ticket sits in your inbox while an aunt quietly leaves an apartment key beside your coffee.",
    "return.temporary_return_4.ending_exhausted_departure": "The Open Return Ticket",
    "return.temporary_return_4.ending_home_again": "Home Again",
    "return.temporary_return_4.text": "The final morning arrives without resolving whether departure is failure, wisdom, or simply another route home.",
    "return.temporary_return_event_1.text": "The day contributes its own amendment.",
    "return.temporary_return_event_1a.proceed": "Write down the family promises",
    "return.temporary_return_event_1a.text": "The old hotel ledger still carries your family's name from a wedding in 1986.",
    "return.temporary_return_event_1b.proceed": "Let lunch decide the afternoon",
    "return.temporary_return_event_1b.text": "A conference fills the hotel and relocates you to a room above the kitchen.",
    "return.temporary_return_event_2.text": "A seeded interruption arrives on schedule.",
    "return.temporary_return_event_2a.proceed": "Walk the neighbourhood at dawn",
    "return.temporary_return_event_2a.text": "The apartment is small, sunny, and legally entangled only in ordinary ways.",
    "return.temporary_return_event_2b.proceed": "Take one last airport taxi",
    "return.temporary_return_event_2b.text": "The taxi driver gives a complete economic forecast before the ring road.",
    "return.var_connections.label": "Old Connections",
    "return.var_preparation.label": "Local Knowledge",
    "return.var_pressure.label": "Homesickness",
    "return.village_return_1.listen": "Listen to the neighbour's full history",
    "return.village_return_1.push": "Start repairs before anyone can advise you",
    "return.village_return_1.text": "The village house is beautiful from the road and urgently educational from inside. A neighbour arrives before the electricity does.",
    "return.village_return_2.improvise": "Buy tiles and hope",
    "return.village_return_2.prepare": "Check the deeds before the roof",
    "return.village_return_2.text": "The well works, the roof mostly works, and four relatives disagree about which wall technically belongs to whom.",
    "return.village_return_3.favour": "Call in the favour you earned",
    "return.village_return_3.favour_fail": "No one owes you that favour yet.",
    "return.village_return_3.steady": "Use what you prepared",
    "return.village_return_3.text": "You trade a day of clearing weeds for a hand-drawn map of pipes, boundaries, and grudges.",
    "return.village_return_4.ending_settled_in_the_village": "A Light in the Village",
    "return.village_return_4.text": "Winter makes the village honest. The quiet is generous; the distance to everything is not.",
    "return.village_return_event_1.text": "The day contributes its own amendment.",
    "return.village_return_event_1a.proceed": "Photograph the map",
    "return.village_return_event_1a.text": "The map reveals a stopcock hidden beneath a plum tree and two decades of leaves.",
    "return.village_return_event_1b.proceed": "Follow the pipe that sounds least theoretical",
    "return.village_return_event_1b.text": "The first pipe you touch introduces itself by flooding the pantry.",
    "return.village_return_event_2.text": "A seeded interruption arrives on schedule.",
    "return.village_return_event_2a.proceed": "Ask who has the tractor",
    "return.village_return_event_2a.text": "The tractor owner arrives with rope, coffee, and no interest in payment.",
    "return.village_return_event_2b.proceed": "Wait for the mobile shop",
    "return.village_return_event_2b.text": "The mobile shop skips Tuesday because Tuesday has become Wednesday locally."
